  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons cayenne pepper",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "2 eggs",
    "1 cup vegetable oil",
    "1 pound skinless, boneless chicken breast halves, cut into 1-inch pieces",
    "0.25 cup hot sauce",
    "1 tablespoon chopped garlic",
    "1 teaspoon butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YrVy5ipKzaCs8xeaYh3Yx8GGcLk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-234538-buffalo-chicken-bites-step-01-77e1a4dcea3e44188a3854fbb9bdd45d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234538/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk flour, cayenne pepper, salt, and pepper together in a bowl. Beat eggs together in a separate bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JrD5oHTSPVuFcCk88K5jKihz25o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-234538-buffalo-chicken-bites-step-02-98a71b5ac15d4fb59f7ba3b443f8a584.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234538/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip chicken pieces in egg; transfer chicken to flour mixture and coat completely. Heat oil in a saucepan over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yQe1RJTe946doK326rw1ZqccXgU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-234538-buffalo-chicken-bites-step-03-b25d8dbdbb1e4c3b9cc46e7c42d65605.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234538/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fry coated chicken pieces in hot oil, working in batches, until no longer pink in the center, about 3 minutes per side; drain on a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ko5eWpRoNNXew0GaHAAIubNrnXk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-234538-buffalo-chicken-bites-step-04-226315084bb9422eba8086fd1c0f8a93.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234538/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine hot sauce, garlic, and butter in a microwave-safe bowl; heat in the microwave until butter is melted and sauce is warm, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3ItwklA2DABj0DAawBCtFC-LCZY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-234538-buffalo-chicken-bites-step-05-140c17cdd9a4496fb2dbd9d903da5f21.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234538/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot sauce mixture as a dipping sauce or pour over buffalo chicken bites.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EPq5vxX8zSCSE-UmWhwW3jA2Aqs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-234538-buffalo-chicken-bites-step-06-c2b054283a4e45a5a62d824073f533e5.jpg"
      ],
